    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d390">

                <pb facs="0496" n="486" sameAs="frus:frus1944v02/pg486"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.796/897</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Australian Prime Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Curtin</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi><anchor n="25" xml:id="d390-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-06-05">5 June, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Cordell Hull</hi>: I refer to Mr. Winant’s
                    letter to me of 4th May,<anchor n="26" xml:id="d390-f2"/> in which he enquired
                    whether I would be disposed to hold exploratory talks on postwar international
                    aviation in Washington on my return from London.</p>
                <p>Under date 13th May I sent an interim reply.<anchor n="27" xml:id="d390-f3"/> I
                    now desire to confirm that it would not be practicable for me to arrange for
                    Australia to be represented at the suggested talks at the present time. <pb
                        facs="0497" n="487" xml:id="pg487"/> I shall however examine the matter
                    immediately on my arrival in Australia and will advise you further as soon as I
                    am able.</p>
                <p>Yours faithfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Curtin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d390-f1" n="25" type="source" xml:id="d390-f1-content">
                <p>Written at the Australian Legation.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d390-f2" n="26" xml:id="d390-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram 3548, May 3, 11 p.m., to London, <ref target="#pg464">p.
                    464</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d390-f3" n="27" xml:id="d390-f3-content">
                <p>See telegram 3934. May 15, from London, <ref target="#pg476">p. 476</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
